<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-function">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.IsLinkGLTFMaterial(link: number, face: number): boolean`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`integer llIsLinkGLTFMaterial(integer link, integer face);`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Returns a <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Integer/boolean" target="_blank">boolean</a> (an <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Integer" target="_blank">integer</a>) that is <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/TRUE" target="_blank">TRUE</a> if the material is PBR and <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/FALSE" target="_blank">FALSE</a> if it is <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/PBR_Materials#Nomenclature_changes" target="_blank">Blinn-Phong</a> diffuse texture on <b>face</b></p>
</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>number</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>integer</span></td>
          <td><a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Parameters/link" target="_blank">link</a></td>
          <td>Link to inspect for PBR, may be <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LINK_THIS" target="_blank">LINK_THIS</a> or <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LINK_ROOT" target="_blank">LINK_ROOT</a></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>number</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>integer</span></td>
          <td><a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Parameters/face" target="_blank">face</a></td>
          <td><b>Face</b> to examine for PBR, or <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/ALL_SIDES" target="_blank">ALL_SIDES</a></td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
